Package: logical
Type: Package
Title: Predictions from a Logical Model of Minority Representation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuki", "Atsusaka", 
           email = "yuki.atsusaka@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes and visualizes quantitative predictions from the logical
    model of minority representation developed by Atsusaka (2021)
    <doi:10.1017/S000305542100054X>. Functions support district-level prediction,
    jurisdiction-level simulation, and redistricting scenario analysis.
License: GPL-3
